    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 31,
      "title": {
        "en": "Enthusiastic and compassionate veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Brooklyn pet owners express strong enthusiasm for the clinical team at Ivy Pets in Midwood. Reviewers frequently highlight Dr. Guss, Dr. Miller, and assistants like Vanessa and Lenni for their warmth, energy, and reassuring bedside manner. Clients describe staff as genuinely devoted to pet welfare, although two reviewers felt the practice was more focused on revenue than patient care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and loving treatment for pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients repeatedly mention how gently their cats and dogs are treated during routine exams, puppy visits, and urgent medical care. Reviewers note that technicians take time to comfort anxious animals, keeping pets calm during flea treatments and haircuts. Many owners note that their pets actually look forward to visiting the clinic thanks to the affectionate and respectful environment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Responsive customer service and clear guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently praise the clinic's customer service, noting prompt phone assistance and clear explanations from veterinary assistants and doctors. Clients appreciate that staff answer questions thoroughly and accommodate urgent same-day appointments when pets are sick. Even when an initial phone inquiry felt rocky, clients report excellent in-person follow-through."
      }
    }
  ],
